  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"> <br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antiblocksrechiseled\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fantiblocksrechiseled%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h3>Fabric 版本：<br></h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.manmaed.net/devins-badges/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><p>本模组以全新色彩重新加入来自 Chisel 的反光方块！此模组採用全亮度设定，方块会散发亮度等级15的光源</p><p>请注意，这并非 Chisel 或其他反光方块类模组的衍生版本</p><p>自 1.20.1+ 版本起，所有载入器皆通过<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>支援CTM（连接纹理）功能</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/530/590/2022-12-02_01.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
